und.all players start at the fragrant jade	   case #7 - the killing of sam ferry   it was 10:00 a.m. on a gloriouswednesday, july 24th. the humidity wasdown and the temperature looked like itwas going to stay in the low 80's. sgt.haskill was reading a "new york times"editorial praisi
